## Version 0.2.1 — 2025-01-17 — pietro gerletti

* Commented out the slurm part of fixtures to run locally.
* Implemented test for single seeded simulation.
* Fixed ghost-Data-folder bug (Data created in working directory; use
  config.set_data_dir(path) to change).
* Moved create-population into simulation.py and sequencing-dataset writing into
  output_manager.
* Fixed wrong output path and unsaved-plot bugs; moved plots to plots_manager.
* Renamed output variables for consistency (variant_inf_count → lineage_frequency).
* Implemented plotting from saved data files; tested and debugged.
* Fixed infection tree and wrote tests for it; tree no longer stores the full
  sequence (available from individuals_data.csv).
* Updated Nexus tree export; wrote test for phylogenetic tree (built from
  phylogenetic_data.csv).
* Fixed fasta writing and the genome decoder (all mutations introduced when
  decoding).
* Implemented tree-builder module; created tree tests.
* Fixed variable-name conflict in tree rendering.
* Created and tested new runme for local machines.

